OL,3,AWho could replace Jensen Huang as
OL,4,ANvidia's chief executive?
OL,5,
OL,6,FNvidia is facing a scenario few would
OL,7,Fhave considered until very recently - a
OL,8,Ffuture without Jensen Huang.
OL,10,FThe chief executive and co-founder of
OL,11,Fthe AI chip-making giant is at the
OL,12,Fcentre of a major scandal over reports
OL,13,Fof extramarital affairs, one of which
OL,14,Fwas with a woman suspected of being a
OL,15,FChinese spy.
OL,17,FNvidia's board is reportedly meeting to
OL,18,Fdiscuss whether to replace Huang.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
