OL,3,AWho could replace Jensen Huang as
OL,4,ANvidia's chief executive?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut finding the right person to lead
OL,7,Fthe business that Huang helped create
OL,8,Fmore than three decades ago and turned
OL,9,Finto the world's second most valuable
OL,10,Fcompany - after Apple - is a challenge.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
