OL,3,ASchools, libraries and parents face
OL,4,Adilemma over David Walliams books
OL,5,
OL,6,FWalliams sold more than 50 million
OL,7,Fcopies of books including Gangsta
OL,8,FGranny and Billionaire Boy. He has
OL,9,Fdenied allegations of sexual misconduct
OL,10,Fand abuses of power.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
