OL,3,AKing Charles appears on Sir Elton
OL,4,AJohn's radio show
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pair discussed some of their
OL,7,Ffavourite musical performances, as well
OL,8,Fas the role music has played in the
OL,9,FKing's charity, the King's Trust. The
OL,10,Fshow was recorded in secret last month
OL,11,Fand will air this Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
